Third-party material

1. imbl (vendor/imbl)
   Immutable collection library by Bodil Stokke and Joe Neeman.
   License: MPL-2.0. See vendor/imbl/LICENCE.md.
   Its Cargo.toml says "MPL-2.0+".

2. Clojure library sources and ports
   Files with a "Copyright (c) Rich Hickey" header (some name other
   contributors, for example Reid Draper and Stuart Halloway), under:
     core/lib/clojure/
     tests/clojure-suite/vendor/
     tests/clojure-suite/vendor-libs/
   This covers ports of clojure.walk, clojure.zip, clojure.stacktrace,
   clojure.pprint, clojure.data, clojure.test, test.check and spec.alpha.
   License: EPL-1.0, the same as this project.

3. Clojure core docstrings
   core/core-docs.dat holds the :added, :arglists and :doc data of
   clojure.core vars. tools/gen-core-docs.sh and tools/gen-core-docs.clj
   generate it from a real Clojure classpath.
   License: EPL-1.0.

4. nREPL 1.8.0
   Origin: https://github.com/nrepl/nrepl. License: EPL-1.0.
   Used in:
     crates/mova-nrepl/src/describe.rs (data copied from the nREPL
       1.8.0 describe reply)
     core/lib/nrepl/ (nrepl.* API namespaces)
     crates/mova-nrepl/oracle/goldens*/ (replies recorded from a JVM
       nREPL server)
